msgid "Applies to all projects on this machine. Claude and Codex started from the built-in terminal, and any agent in an in-app Agents panel chat, auto-approve OpenKnowledge's read and write tools (Claude also auto-runs \"{cliCommand} open\"). Deleting, moving, sharing, importing or installing skills, other commands, and non-OpenKnowledge file edits still ask. In the terminal, Cursor, OpenCode, and Pi are unaffected. Best-effort per agent."
